Matt Bunday wrote:
> I just polymorphed my pet red naga hatchling into a arch-lich. I've
> heard stories that liches will un-tame. Is having him around safe?

They un-tame after a while if you get separated (different dungeon
level) from your pet. So if you or your pet stepped on a trapdoor
or a hole try to rejoin, don't delay that effort by handling other
tasks. Worse might be if your pet hits a level teleport trap; then
you have to search your pet from top of the dungeon down.

> I'm currently a xlvl 12 Rogue with GDSM and Grayswandir.

With this equipment you might as well be able to kill it if there's
any necessity to do so. But more likely you will be killed; if not
by the arch-lich then by the monsters that he summons.

